:: Deadwood Raven Shrine Daily
<<set $outside to 1>><<effects>><<deadwood-raven-shrine-presence>>
<<if !_shrine or _shrine.stage lt 3 or $location isnot 'forest_raven_shrine'>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You are no longer in the shrine courtyard.' '你已经不在神社庭院了。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>>
  <<exit>>
<</if>>
<<if !_shrineSafe>>
  <<lanSwitch 'You cannot continue the visit now.' '你现在没法继续这次拜访。'>><br><br>
  <<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>><<exit>>
<</if>>
<<switch _shrine.action>>
  <<case 'prayer' 'donate'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<if _shrine.action is 'donate'>>You slip a few coins into the offering box before sitting down.<<else>>You sit beside the offering box, smoothing a corner of the cushion.<</if>>
        Someone has tied a small wooden wish plaque to the railing. Its writing has faded beyond reading.
        <br><br>
        You keep your own wish to yourself. Water knocks softly against the basin. For a while, you let that sound fill the silence.
        <<if $fallenangel gte 6 and isPartEnabled($transformationParts?.fallenAngel?.wings ?? 'disabled')>>The weight at your back settles as you lower your shoulders.<<elseif $angel gte 6 and isPartEnabled($transformationParts?.angel?.wings ?? 'disabled')>>Your feathers shift when a breeze reaches the veranda.<<elseif $demon gte 6 and isPartEnabled($transformationParts?.demon?.tail ?? 'disabled')>>You find room for your tail beside the cushion.<</if>>
        <br><br>
        You stay a little longer, then stand when you are ready.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<if _shrine.action is 'donate'>>你把几枚硬币投入奉纳箱，才坐下来。<<else>>你在奉纳箱旁坐下，轻轻抚平坐垫的一角。<</if>>
        栏杆上系着一块小小的绘马，字迹已经褪得认不清了。
        <br><br>
        你把自己的心愿留在心里。水轻轻碰着石盆，有一阵子，你只听着这个声音。
        <<if $fallenangel gte 6 and isPartEnabled($transformationParts?.fallenAngel?.wings ?? 'disabled')>>你松下肩膀，背后的重量也渐渐安稳。<<elseif $angel gte 6 and isPartEnabled($transformationParts?.angel?.wings ?? 'disabled')>>微风吹到廊下，你的羽毛轻轻动了动。<<elseif $demon gte 6 and isPartEnabled($transformationParts?.demon?.tail ?? 'disabled')>>你在坐垫旁给尾巴留出了位置。<</if>>
        <br><br>
        你又坐了一会儿，等心绪平静下来才起身。
    <</language>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
  <<case 'rest'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You sit on a flat stone beside the pond. The overflow runs between two roots and disappears downhill.
        <<if Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>You keep beneath the shelter of the cedar branches.<<elseif Weather.isSnow>>The middle of the pond is dark, ringed with thin ice.<<else>>A leaf turns slowly on the water.<</if>>
        <br><br>
        A raven lands a few paces away. It waits until you stop watching, then takes a drink. You rest your feet until it flies off.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你在池边的平石上坐下。溢出的水从两条树根之间流过，往山下去了。
        <<if Weather.precipitation is 'rain'>>你靠在杉树枝条遮得到的地方。<<elseif Weather.isSnow>>池心还是暗的，周围结着一层薄冰。<<else>>一片叶子在水上慢慢转着。<</if>>
        <br><br>
        一只渡鸦落在几步之外。等你不再盯着它看，它才低头饮水。你歇着脚，直到它飞走。
    <</language>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>>
  <<default>>
    <<lanSwitch 'You linger in the courtyard for a moment.' '你在庭院里停留片刻。'>>
<</switch>><br><br>
<<deadwood-raven-shrine-return>>
